Subject: [PATCH 232/270] ARM bring-up: tegra_dc_diag, a read-only report of
 the Tegra 2 display hardware (not for merging)

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
---
 src/add-ons/kernel/drivers/misc/Jamfile       |   1 +
 .../kernel/drivers/misc/tegra_dc_diag/Jamfile |   7 +
 .../misc/tegra_dc_diag/tegra_dc_diag.cpp      | 446 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 454 insertions(+)
